  "as_of_notes": "Report titled 'West Virginia Voter Registration as of May 31. 2026' (latest monthly report on the WV SOS Voter Registration Totals page; PDF at https://sos.wv.gov/media/706/download?inline=). Source breaks registrations into Democrat, Republican, Mountain, Libertarian, Constitution, No Party, and Other. To fit this schema's party fields, the 'Constitution' party count was folded into 'Other' (statewide Constitution=171; Other-as-reported=35,370, so combined Other=35,541). 'NoParty' maps to the source 'No Party' column.",
  "data_quality": "high - official monthly statewide report; all 55 counties present; every county row total equals the sum of its party columns; each party column sums exactly to the published statewide total; sum of county totals (1,199,505) equals published grand total.",
  "notes": "Statewide totals as published: Democrat 326,834; Republican 521,418; Mountain 2,730; Libertarian 10,755; Constitution 171; No Party 302,227; Other 35,370; Total 1,199,505. Published party percentages: Dem 27.25%, Rep 43.47%, Mtn 0.23%, Lib 0.90%, Constitution 0.01%, No Party 25.20%, Other 2.95%. Stable per-state PDF index page used as source_url; direct PDF for this month: https://sos.wv.gov/media/706/download?inline=."
}